#
#   selector_2 - CSS::Selector: serialization, nesting (relative_to, absolutized), the sibling
#                invalidation distance and the An+B pattern
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/Selector.cpp (lines 334-979): PseudoElementSelector::serialize,
#       SimpleSelector::serialize, Selector::serialize, is_legacy_single_colon_pseudo_element,
#       serialize_a_group_of_selectors, relative_to, contains_unknown_webkit_pseudo_element,
#       the absolutized() of Selector, CompoundSelector and SimpleSelector,
#       contains_invalid_contents_for_has, sibling_invalidation_distance,
#       adapt_nested_relative_selector_list and ANPlusBPattern's matches and serialize.
